d unsettling noises echo through the halls. Shadows seem to move on their own, creeping across the walls as if alive. The deeper you go, the more you realize \u2014 something is terribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/extras/d61cc8a4ff959ac83419c65568672136.poster.avif?t=1764093243\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/extras/d61cc8a4ff959ac83419c65568672136.webm?t=1764093243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/extras/d61cc8a4ff959ac83419c65568672136.mp4?t=1764093243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Indian ghost stories, <i>Thekku Island</i> blends <strong>psychological horror</strong>, <strong>classic ghost encounters</strong>, and <strong>jumpscare tension</strong> into an atmospheric experience where <strong>every clue deepens the mystery</strong>. There are no easy answers \u2014 only whispers from the past.</p>","developers":["Ales Devs Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889480/d114e49ae3e4219a454ef9da8c1d41257f87e461/header.jpg?t=1764093243","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Ales Devs Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3889480/1175035276/c794c3129b67b66f02711856af4084b396af0f31/17607